&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Who are we and What do we do?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;InMobi&amp;nbsp;Group’s mission is to power intelligent, mobile-first experiences for enterprises and consumers. Its businesses across advertising, marketing, data and content platforms are shaping consumer experience in a world of connected devices.&amp;nbsp;InMobi&amp;nbsp;Group has been recognized on both the 2018 and 2019 CNBC Disruptor 50 list and as one of Fast Company’s 2018 World’s Most Innovative Companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What’s the InMobi family like?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Consistently featured among the “Great Places to Work” in India since 2017, our culture is our true north, enabling us to think big, solve complex challenges and grow with new opportunities.&amp;nbsp;InMobians&amp;nbsp;are passionate and driven, creative and fun loving, take ownership and are results focused. We invite you to free yourself, dream big and chase your passion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What do we promise?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We offer an opportunity to have an immediate impact on the company and our products. The work that you shall do will be mission critical for&amp;nbsp;InMobi&amp;nbsp;and will be critical for optimizing tech operations, working with highly capable and ambitious peer groups. At&amp;nbsp;InMobi, you get food for your body, soul, and mind with daily meals, gym, and yoga classes, cutting-edge training and tools, cocktails at drink cart Thursdays and fun at work on Funky Fridays. We even promise to let you bring your kids and pets to work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi’s Programmatic Buying team works to manage revenue operations and is focused solely on buying media for the company globally. We are focused on winning new business, growing InMobi’s market share, and developing our reputation of being an industry leader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Programmatic Buying team, you will be playing a critical operations and revenue management role at InMobi. You would be completely responsible for setting campaigns, managing and delivering revenue on the “DSP Platform” and you are expected to work closely with all stakeholders (regional sales, supply, product, engineering, marketing and ad ops teams) to drive cross functional support to maximize revenue delivered. He/ she would have to drive revenue reporting and tracking, data analytics and develop insights into supply needs, pricing optimization, product/ tech liaising exercises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for sharp, analytical and growth oriented professionals who can solve complex problems in a structured manner, have experience of working in cross functional roles and develop close strategic relationships with stakeholders, while proactively and clearly communicating data and insights to sales, supply, product teams and to global leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are expected to work for growing the Revenue and Margin for the region/pod allocated by actively collaborating with Customer Success/ Sales teams by understanding the capabilities of the DSP Platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End to End Ownership of Campaign Delivery (Onboarding, Campaign creation, Optimization, Reporting and insights etc) and Strategizing for Revenue growth for both tactical and long-term opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive conversations with Sales/Customer Success teams for the smooth Campaign Delivery, handling the challenges and adopting collaborative workstyle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Derive Insights on various Revenue, Product, and Supply metrics, to collaborate with Product/Supply teams for feature improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet and exceed campaign goals through campaign strategy and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with huge volumes of data to arrive at meaningful insights and strategies about the campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own weekly exec level revenue/ margin reporting for the portfolio of accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take ownership and getting things done in the stipulated time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we require from you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal candidates must possess:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-6 years of experience in a Digital Native / Startup companies, involved Data Analysis with actionable insights / Revenue Management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical skills, entrepreneurial, and a creative approach to problem solving, with the ability to understand key metrics and apply these to performance optimizations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, robust MS Excel skills and proven competency in numeracy and logical reasoning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective and proactive communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding teamwork, organizational &amp;amp; interpersonal skills, with tremendous attention to detail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across different global cultures and in a matrix style environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Who are we and What do we do?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;InMobi&amp;nbsp;Group’s mission is to power intelligent, mobile-first experiences for enterprises and consumers. Its businesses across advertising, marketing, data and content platforms are shaping consumer experience in a world of connected devices.&amp;nbsp;InMobi&amp;nbsp;Group has been recognized on both the 2018 and 2019 CNBC Disruptor 50 list and as one of Fast Company’s 2018 World’s Most Innovative Companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What’s the InMobi family like?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Consistently featured among the “Great Places to Work” in India since 2017, our culture is our true north, enabling us to think big, solve complex challenges and grow with new opportunities.&amp;nbsp;InMobians&amp;nbsp;are passionate and driven, creative and fun loving, take ownership and are results focused. We invite you to free yourself, dream big and chase your passion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What do we promise?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We offer an opportunity to have an immediate impact on the company and our products. The work that you shall do will be mission critical for&amp;nbsp;InMobi&amp;nbsp;and will be critical for optimizing tech operations, working with highly capable and ambitious peer groups. At&amp;nbsp;InMobi, you get food for your body, soul, and mind with daily meals, gym, and yoga classes, cutting-edge training and tools, cocktails at drink cart Thursdays and fun at work on Funky Fridays. We even promise to let you bring your kids and pets to work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi’s Media Buying team works to manage revenue operations and is focused solely on buying media for the company, globally (including China Export Demand) across UA, REM and Brand Awareness. We are focused on winning new business, growing InMobi’s market share, and developing our reputation of being an industry leader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Media Buying team, you will be playing a critical operations and revenue management role at InMobi. You would be completely responsible for setting campaigns, managing and delivering revenue on the “DSP Platform” and you are expected to work closely with all stakeholders (regional sales, supply, product, engineering, marketing and ad ops teams) to drive cross functional support to maximize revenue delivered. He/ she would have to drive revenue reporting and tracking, data analytics and develop insights into supply needs, pricing optimization, product/ tech liaising exercises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for sharp, analytical and growth oriented professionals who can solve complex problems in a structured manner, have experience of working in cross functional roles and develop close strategic relationships with stakeholders, while proactively and clearly communicating data and insights to sales, supply, product teams and to global leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are expected to work for growing the Revenue and Margin for the region/pod allocated by actively collaborating with Customer Success/ Sales teams by understanding the capabilities of the DSP Platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Day to day management of mobile display/video campaigns across various DSPs/Platforms (onboarding, Creation, Optimization, Reporting and insights etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete ownership of revenue (plus margin) management for a portfolio of advertiser clients - Work on the account growth strategy with the Sales and Account Management team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close Monitoring of campaign behavior and ability to act instantly on important issues affecting revenue for the company. Meet and exceed campaign goals through campaign strategy and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with huge volumes of data to arrive at meaningful insights and strategies about the campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own weekly exec level revenue/ margin reporting for the portfolio of accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with various stakeholders like Account management, Product and Tech team to identify and maximize revenue opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take ownership and getting things done in the stipulated time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we require from you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of experience in a role encompassing Account/ Revenue management and data analysis, preferably (not mandatory) from digital/ programmatic/ad tech background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech or B.Sc in Statistics, Mathematics, or other quantitative or analytical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal candidates must possess:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good relationship management skills, communication, attention to detail, analytical mindset, technical aptitude with a basic to medium level understanding of the digital ad marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, robust MS Excel skills and proven competency in data analysis and logical reasoning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior client facing experience while owning revenue management for a product/ business line/ account/ geography (Good to have)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across different global cultures and in a matrix style environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured thinking: Ability to think through issues in a structured manner and use different frameworks to solve problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication skills: Ability to present recommendations in a logical and clearly articulated manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic to medium proficiency in the ad tech ecosystem of ad exchanges/ networks, DSPs, 1st and 3rd party audience targeting and technology, online measurement, ad-operations, delivery and measurement platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding teamwork, organizational &amp;amp; interpersonal skills, with tremendous attention to detail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across different global cultures and in a matrix style environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Lead Client Growth Manager - Performance will join our rapidly expanding Performance team in the Americas region — a group at the forefront of innovation within the mobile in-app advertising ecosystem. In a fast-moving and ever-evolving landscape, this team delivers differentiated, high-impact performance solutions powered by market-leading SKAN capabilities, one of the world&#39;s largest in-app mobile exchanges, and uniquely advantaged inventory through global telco and OEM partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At InMobi, our culture is our true north. It empowers us to think boldly, solve complex challenges, and unlock meaningful growth opportunities for our clients and our business. InMobians are passionate, driven, creative, and ownership-minded — and we are deeply results-focused. Your work in this role will be highly visible, with direct impact across the organization. You&#39;ll collaborate with an ambitious, high-caliber peer group that is invested in your success, while benefiting from a strong commitment to continuous learning and professional development through both internal and external resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to play a pivotal role in shaping client growth strategy within one of the most dynamic and strategically important areas of digital advertising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deepen client relationships with the goal of becoming a top strategic partner, driving maximum campaign ROI by understanding advertiser objectives, KPIs, and operational nuances (technical integrations, creative strategy, supply dynamics, delivery optimizations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead in-depth campaign analysis and performance reviews; provide consultative, data-driven guidance in weekly and bi-weekly discussions, and confidently drive Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track account-level revenue and delivery priorities on a weekly basis, contributing insights to CXO-level reporting and strategic planning conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive quarterly account retention, revenue, and margin targets, while identifying opportunities for upsell and cross-sell to expand the overall book of business. Partner closely with Sales on strategic account planning and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders (traders, ad operations, and cross-functional partners) to optimize day-to-day campaign performance and implement high-impact strategic improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside Sales Engineering to coordinate with third-party partners such as MMPs, viewability providers, data platforms (DMPs), and attribution solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an in-market product expert, partnering with Product and Engineering teams to provide feedback, drive adoption, and elevate AM-region execution standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Experience We Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional experience, including 3–4+ years within the programmatic, demand-side advertising space — ideally in performance or growth marketing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in client-facing roles with a track record of delivering measurable business outcomes. Experience working with DSPs and/or MMPs is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic mindset with a strong focus on revenue growth and retention; demonstrated success in driving account expansion and long-term client partnerships is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with standard business tools, including Salesforce, Microsoft Office Suite, and reporting/visualization platforms such as Power BI and Tableau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple clients and campaigns simultaneously with strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and disciplined time management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort collaborating with global teams across time zones and planning work accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree from an accredited college or university required; background in advertising, marketing, business, or STEM fields is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At InMobi, you’ll be surrounded by people who…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think big and act fast:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We’re entrepreneurial, thrive in ambiguity, and love solving high-impact problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are passionate, fanatically driven, and take immense pride in their work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We care deeply about the impact we create and continuously push our potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own their outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We take responsibility, make bold decisions, and execute with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace freedom with accountability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We value autonomy and understand that trust comes with responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Believe in lifelong learning:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We welcome feedback, challenge ourselves to grow, and aren’t afraid to take smart risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Award-winning culture, best-in-class benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Our compensation philosophy enables us to provide a competitive salary that drives high performance while balancing business needs and pay parity. We&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;determine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;compensation based on a wide variety of factors, including role, nature of experience,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;skills,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary (fixed) for this role ranges from&lt;strong&gt; $109,500 to $148,000 USD&lt;/strong&gt; (min to max of base salary pay range). This salary range is applicable to our offices located in California and New York&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;. In addition, an InMobian may also receive variable pay in the form of an annual variable bonus or quarterly variable bonus/sales incentive, as deemed per policy, in addition to fixed compensation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Our ranges may vary based on the final location and region of the role in accordance with the geographical differentiation in pay scales in the country.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to cash compensation, based on the position, an InMobian can receive equity in the form of a stock grant known as ESOPs (Employee Stock Option Plan). To encourage a spirit of shared ownership, we believe that our employees should have the ability to own a part of the organization. Furthermore, as you contribute to the growth of the company, additional stock may be issued in recognition of your contribution over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A quick snapshot of our benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and ESOP grant (where applicable)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality medical, dental, and vision insurance (including company-matched HSA)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) company match&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous combination of vacation time, sick days, special occasion time, and company-wide holidays &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial maternity and paternity leave benefits and a compassionate work environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours to suit everyone&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness stipend for a healthier you!&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch provided in our offices daily&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet-friendly work environment and robust pet insurance policy - because we love our animals!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;If this sounds like the kind of team, role, values, benefits, and challenges that excite you, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Go for it!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi is a place where everyone can grow. Howsoever you identify, and whatever background you bring with you, we invite you to apply if this sounds like a role that would make you excited to work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type.  All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, and training. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &amp;amp; What do we do?&lt;/strong&gt;   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group’s mission is to power intelligent, mobile-first experiences for enterprises and consumers. Its businesses across advertising, marketing, data and content platforms are shaping consumer experience in a world of connected devices. InMobi Group has been recognized on both the 2018 and 2019 CNBC Disruptor 50 list and as one of Fast Company’s 2018 World’s Most Innovative Companies.   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s the InMobi family like?&lt;/strong&gt;   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consistently featured among the “Great Places to Work” in India since 2017, our culture is our true north, enabling us to think big, solve complex challenges and grow with new opportunities. InMobians are passionate and driven, creative and fun-loving, take ownership and are results focused. We invite you to free yourself, dream big and chase your passion.   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we promise?&lt;/strong&gt;   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer an opportunity to have an immediate impact on the company and our products. The work that you shall do will be mission critical for InMobi and will be critical for optimizing tech operations, working with highly capable and ambitious peer groups. At InMobi, you get food for your body, soul, and mind with daily meals, gym, and yoga classes, cutting-edge training and tools, cocktails at drink cart Thursdays and fun at work on Funky Fridays. We even promise to let you bring your kids and pets to work.   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is the team like?&lt;/strong&gt;   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Central Operations is often thought of as the engine room, and that&#39;s true we are also the brains that hook various systems together. Inherently, it is the information hub in the company. Core Operations has their feet in both business &amp;amp; operational areas and learns to think about things from both perspectives, giving them a unique, consultative strength. The team has a key seat at the table from a strategic perspective and given the unique strength we possess; we are the people that really make a difference in the operational world.    &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief Description:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&lt;strong&gt; Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;268&quot; data-end=&quot;309&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;– Dealdesk &lt;/strong&gt;will serve as the GTM Operations triage lead for InMobi Exchange, bridging business and operations across time zones. This role partners closely with Sales, Client Development, Agency Development, PTD, DPM, and product teams to drive real-time campaign and deal operations, ensuring flawless execution, same-day triage, and data-driven insight delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;669&quot; data-end=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;This is a demand-heavy role focused on PMP deal analysis, campaign health monitoring, and RFP triage, while also acting as a quality and process gatekeeper. The ideal candidate combines deep adtech expertise, operational excellence, and strong analytical rigor to drive execution efficiency, elevate campaign outcomes, and close feedback loops between GTM and Central Ops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;669&quot; data-end=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, evaluate, and approve complex and non-standard deals across PMPs based campaigns, strategic partnerships, and enterprise agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure pricing, margins, discounts, rebates, and incentives align with company guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive consistency in deal frameworks across regions and business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales to structure strategic deals that balance revenue growth and profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with RevOps to ensure accurate documentation and system alignment (SFDC, BI tools, pricing trackers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with Product and Operations for feasibility validation and operational impact assessment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deal-level P&amp;amp;L analysis including margin, cost allocation, rebates, tech fees, and platform costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model revenue scenarios and long-term account value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify revenue leakage risks and ensure proper controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review historical performance data to inform deal decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and continuously improve Deal Desk SOPs and approval workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce deal scale turnaround time (TAT) without compromising governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement deal approval matrices and automated workflows in SFDC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clean documentation and audit trails for compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish standardized pricing templates and commercial playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track discount trends, margin erosion, exception frequency, and revenue impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular reporting to leadership on deal quality and profitability metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify patterns in pricing pressure and propose a corrective strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data-backed commercial decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of disciplined, data-driven deal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
