&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1420&quot; data-start=&quot;154&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and maintain a scalable design system covering components, patterns, typography, color themes, and overall visual direction, ensuring consistency across web and mobile.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Define and implement the product’s brand identity,&amp;nbsp;including fonts, logo, color palette, iconography, and accessibility standards.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate requirements into user flows, wireframes, prototypes, and high-fidelity designs for dashboards, reporting/analytics pages, campaign workflows, billing, and other SaaS-specific modules.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Deliver responsive, intuitive, and data-driven UI/UX experiences optimized for performance and usability across devices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Work closely with product managers and developers in agile sprints, ensuring fast-paced design delivery and smooth handoff via Figma/Zeplin or similar tools.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Conduct design reviews, enforce quality standards, and iterate designs based on feedback, usability studies, and analytics.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Leverage Lighthouse measurements, design analytics tools (Hotjar, FullStory, etc.), A/B testing, and user research to continuously improve design performance and experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as design lead—mentoring junior designers, fostering a strong design culture, and influencing product roadmap with user-first design thinking.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2414&quot; data-start=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;8–10 years of proven experience designing SaaS platforms (web and mobile), with a strong portfolio showcasing dashboards, data-heavy interfaces, and workflow-driven products.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Expertise in design tools such as Figma, Sketch, Adobe XD, Illustrator, and Miro.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong experience creating and scaling design systems for complex digital products.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Deep understanding of SaaS UX patterns, responsive design, accessibility, and performance optimization.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with front-end frameworks (React, Angular, Flutter) and ability to collaborate effectively with engineering teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience with design analytics, usability testing, and modern UX KPIs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent communication, leadership, and collaboration skills with the ability to deliver at the pace of a high-velocity development team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Nice to have experience in Martech/AdTech platforms, motion design/micro-interactions, multi-language SaaS design, and AI-driven design workflows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
