&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and ESOP grant (where applicable)        &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;High-quality medical, dental, and vision insurance (including company-matched HSA)       &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;401(k) company match &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Generous combination of vacation time, sick days, special occasion time, and company-wide holidays   &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
