&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Sales Manager&lt;/strong&gt; in South Africa you are expected to drive new client acquisition and grow incremental revenue against a targeted list of high potential agencies and advertisers through continuous engagement. You are expected to continually build and maintain a pipeline of clients and agencies to be onboarded to the Microsoft Advertising platform. Collaborate with internal Account Managers and Strategy teams to develop quality customer plans targeted at revenue growth and customer satisfaction. Cultivating strategic client relationships, revenue generation and delivering customized search solutions will be key to your core function. Your success will be measured by specific key performance indicators focused on driving new customer acquisition, product adoption, emphasizing customer experience and optimizing opportunities. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is expected out of you? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the first quarter:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the Microsoft Advertising Ecosystem in South Africa and collaborate with internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage your current relationships in the advertising ecosystem to drive revenue conversations as well as open up new relationships in the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be expected to build a healthy predictable pipeline of clients to initiate and successfully close partnership and onboarding discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently create high value revenue-generating opportunities that will work towards delivering quota expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regular, impactful engagements with key clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with the required teams to help achieve targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Second Quarter Onwards:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master and grow the activities initiated in the first quarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow Bing’s share of wallet by continuing to onboard new clients and agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen relationships with key client and agency stakeholders like (budget decision makers, media planners and senior leadership)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal account managers and client poc&#39;s to ensure opportunities are leveraged effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually strengthen your Search Industry expertise, take personal accountability for your career and personal development;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete required and recommended trainings and apply what you learn to further your growth in role and career progression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role requirement &amp;amp; expectation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 years of work experience with 3+ years of online media sales/digital advertising experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network of clientele in the South African marketplace, specifically Johannesburg and an understanding of the key digital players (Brands, agencies etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and ability to build a client base from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in lead generation, networking, and ad-agency relationship management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced Digital media solution seller and talented in storytelling and delivering engaging presentations across all levels of leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle and manage key/strategic client relationships and revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a strong metrics focused approach is applied in business planning and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to understand customer needs, create and deliver customized, customer-focused pitches and solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of exceptional performance, high productivity, communications skills, and meeting deadlines. Demonstrated ability to consistently meet or exceed revenue goals or targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for technology as an enabler for company growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively navigate through ambiguity and complexities related to client management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practice freedom with responsibility, entrepreneurial mindset and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess excellent communication skills providing transparency and enabling information radiators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to meet and strengthen partnerships with new and existing clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Search Engine Marketing Experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the Digital Ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ad Sales Experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Johannesburg&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

