&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates ability to multi-task and re-prioritize responsibilities based on changing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide functional, design, and code reviews in related areas of expertise with-in team and cross-team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimates efforts, identify risks, devises and meets project schedules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rises above detail to see broader issues and implications for whole product/team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What do we expect from you? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;7-11 years of experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong scripting skills in Python, Shell&amp;nbsp;etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience in Cloud (Azure/AWS/GCP), Kubernetes ecosystem, Continuous Integration and Delivery (CI/CD), Infrastructure automation, Automation and Scripting, Networking, Linux container and cluster management&lt;/li&gt;
