&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience on high throughput microservices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Expertise in Kubernetes to deploy scale, load balance, and manage Docker containers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of build automation and building CI/CD pipelines in Kubernetes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong experience in Kubernetes ecosystem - Helm, skaffold&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Expertise in Infrastructure as a code(IaC) e.g., Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Expertise in configuring the monitoring and alerting tools like Prometheus/Grafana, dashboarding, Alerts setup etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Champion of automation. Must be doing automation daily from dev to deploy. To remove any needs of manual intervention &amp;amp; Debugging into the system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Understanding of observability and traceability&lt;/li&gt;
