&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong computer fundamentals and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
