&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Must be excited by challenges surrounding the development of highly scalable &amp;amp; distributed system for building audience targeting capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
