&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn the Data Scientist&#39;s findings into production systems: finetuning/distillation pipelines, routing algorithms, cost-optimization logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build data pipelines and platform components as owned products with real interfaces, not one-off scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the engineering rigor of shared evaluation infrastructure so both model work and algorithm work rely on the same trusted foundation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship, monitor, and iterate on what&#39;s in production, closing the loop back to the Data Scientist on what&#39;s working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software/ML engineering fundamentals — production code quality, comfort building and shipping pipelines and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine willingness to learn model finetuning and distillation on the job — prior experience is a plus, not a requirement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Algorithmic thinking for routing/optimization problems under cost, latency, and non-determinism constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working from someone else&#39;s analysis rather than always originating the “what should we build” question&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Senior Account Manager is part of the Direct &amp;amp; Programmatic Demand team, embedded within a revenue pod alongside a dedicated Sales Manager, and working closely with agencies and advertisers across the Americas. Reporting to the VP, Ad Sales, this role will own new customer onboarding, delivering success for their campaigns and new upsell/cross-sell opportunities — while leading internal coordination with sales planning, operations, creative solutions, insights, measurement partnerships, supply partnerships, and tech teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Client-facing and regionally embedded, the Lead AM is a primary point of contact for the agency, owns the health of the account post-sale, and is directly responsible for identifying and closing upsell opportunities — that build on the success of the campaigns they run.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;em&gt;This role is open to candidates based in Chicago, IL. &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Some travel may be required for client meetings and events as needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Make:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140,&amp;quot;335572079&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335572080&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335572081&amp;quot;:11891758,&amp;quot;469789806&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Onboard new advertiser customers in your Revenue pod onto InMobi and Glance ad systems and infrastructure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end delivery and KPI optimization of every deal sold by Sales Manager partners — coordinating research, creative, attribution, ad operations, and any other specialist teams required to execute what was sold.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Act as the client&#39;s day-to-day point of contact post-sale, managing quarterly account retention and growth plans, revenue and margin management, and overall account health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Own upsell and cross-sell goals for your managed accounts — and track all upsell activities in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Partner with your Sales Managers to co-own the account&#39;s long-term strategy, bringing proactive, data-driven recommendations and account intelligence that support the pod&#39;s overall revenue growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Lead campaign analysis and reviews; provide consultative guidance to clients in weekly or bi-weekly check-ins and quarterly business reviews (QBRs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Manage the full solution lifecycle for campaigns individually and across partner teams — pre-sale media planning support, client onboarding, campaign delivery, in-flight optimization, and post-campaign reporting and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with product, revenue strategy, technical account management (TAM), product marketing, ad operations, creative, insights, agency development, and demand partner teams to ensure successful execution and fast resolution of client issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Work with Technical Account Management and Ops teams to troubleshoot campaign issues, and liaise directly with third-party partners such as DSPs, DMPs, and measurement vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Escalate at-risk accounts early — pacing issues, unresolved service problems, or stakeholder changes at the client &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Prioritize your week around what each account in your book needs — a renewal conversation, a QBR, resolving a client issue&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Surface marketplace feedback and client insights to inform InMobi&#39;s broader product and go-to-market strategy&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;How You&#39;re Measured:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role is goaled on two connected outcomes:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Pod revenue growth — shared accountability with your Sales Manager partners for the overall revenue performance of the accounts in your pod&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Individual revenue contribution — a dedicated, separately tracked upsell target generated from the deals you manage, logged and measured in Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;The Experience We Need:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;8+ years of overall client success or account management experience, including at least 4 years in digital and/or programmatic advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A proven track record of owning post-sale account health and driving measurable retention and growth within existing client accounts, including experience carrying or contributing to an upsell/renewal target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong ownership instincts and proactive communication — comfortable operating as one half of a tight, paired pod (AM + Seller) rather than managing an undifferentiated account list.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong account management and client success experience, including managing complex agency and brand relationships and co-owning account strategy with a sales partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with major DSPs and platforms such as The Trade Desk (TTD), DV360, and Amazon DSP is a strong plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success partnering with cross-functional teams (Sales, Ad Ops, Creative, Insights, Product) and building trusted relationships internally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce, Microsoft Excel, PowerPoint, and analytics/BI tools &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills — comfortable interpreting campaign data to identify performance trends, risks, and upsell opportunities, and translating them into clear client recommendations &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Excellent organizational and time-management skills, with the ability to manage multiple clients, campaigns, and stakeholders simultaneously, and to reprioritize quickly as account needs shift &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Willingness and flexibility to work with global teams across several time zones&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Why InMobi?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of a global team shaping the future of the open internet&#39;s advertising ecosystem — with visible impact, a supportive and ambitious peer group, and continuous investment in your growth. InMobi offers competitive compensation, comprehensive benefits, and a culture built on ownership, curiosity, and results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At InMobi, you’ll be surrounded by people who…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think big and act fast:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We’re entrepreneurial, thrive in ambiguity, and love solving high-impact problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are passionate, fanatically driven, and take immense pride in their work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We care deeply about the impact we create and continuously push our potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own their outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We take responsibility, make bold decisions, and execute with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace freedom with accountability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We value autonomy and understand that trust comes with responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Believe in lifelong learning:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We welcome feedback, challenge ourselves to grow, and aren’t afraid to take smart risks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Award-winning culture, best-in-class benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Our compensation philosophy enables us to provide a competitive salary that drives high performance while balancing business needs and pay parity. We&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;determine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;compensation based on a wide variety of factors, including role, nature of experience,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;skills,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The base salary (fixed salary) for this role ranges from &lt;strong&gt;$140,500 to $175,000 USD&lt;/strong&gt; (minimum to maximum base salary). This salary range is applicable to our offices located in California and New York&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;In addition, an InMobian may also receive variable pay in the form of an annual variable bonus or quarterly variable bonus/sales incentive, as deemed per policy, in addition to fixed compensation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Our ranges may vary based on the final location or region of the role in accordance with the geographical differentiation in pay scales in the country.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to cash compensation, based on the position, an InMobian can receive equity in the form of ESOPs (Employee Stock Option Plan). We believe that our employees/personnel should have the ability to own a part of the entity they are a part of. Therefore, the entity employing you may elect to provide such stock to you. Ownership of stock enables us to treat our employer company as our own and base our decisions on the company’s best interests. To encourage a spirit of shared ownership, we grant InMobians relevant company stock(s). As you contribute to the growth of your company, certain stocks may be issued to you in recognition of your contribution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A quick snapshot of our U.S. benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and ESOP grant (where applicable)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality medical, dental, and vision insurance (including company-matched HSA)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) company match&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous combination of vacation time, sick days, special occasion time, and company-wide holidays &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial maternity and paternity leave benefits and compassionate work environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours to suit everyone&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness stipend for a healthier you!&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch is provided in our offices daily&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet-friendly work environment and robust pet insurance policy - because we love our animals!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the kind of team, role, values, benefits, and challenges that excite you, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Go for it!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi is a place where everyone can grow. Howsoever you identify, and whatever background you bring with you, we invite you to apply if this sounds like a role that would make you excited to work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type.  All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, and training. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Senior Account Manager is part of the Direct &amp;amp; Programmatic Demand team, embedded within a revenue pod alongside a dedicated Sales Manager, and working closely with agencies and advertisers across the Americas. Reporting to the VP, Ad Sales, this role will own new customer onboarding, delivering success for their campaigns and new upsell/cross-sell opportunities — while leading internal coordination with sales planning, operations, creative solutions, insights, measurement partnerships, supply partnerships, and tech teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Client-facing and regionally embedded, the Lead AM is a primary point of contact for the agency, owns the health of the account post-sale, and is directly responsible for identifying and closing upsell opportunities — that build on the success of the campaigns they run.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;em&gt;T&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;his role is bas&lt;/em&gt;ed on-site in our NYC office. Some travel may be required for client meetings and events as needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Make:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140,&amp;quot;335572079&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335572080&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335572081&amp;quot;:11891758,&amp;quot;469789806&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Onboard new advertiser customers in your Revenue pod onto InMobi and Glance ad systems and infrastructure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end delivery and KPI optimization of every deal sold by Sales Manager partners — coordinating research, creative, attribution, ad operations, and any other specialist teams required to execute what was sold.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Act as the client&#39;s day-to-day point of contact post-sale, managing quarterly account retention and growth plans, revenue and margin management, and overall account health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Own upsell and cross-sell goals for your managed accounts — and track all upsell activities in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Partner with your Sales Managers to co-own the account&#39;s long-term strategy, bringing proactive, data-driven recommendations and account intelligence that support the pod&#39;s overall revenue growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Lead campaign analysis and reviews; provide consultative guidance to clients in weekly or bi-weekly check-ins and quarterly business reviews (QBRs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Manage the full solution lifecycle for campaigns individually and across partner teams — pre-sale media planning support, client onboarding, campaign delivery, in-flight optimization, and post-campaign reporting and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with product, revenue strategy, technical account management (TAM), product marketing, ad operations, creative, insights, agency development, and demand partner teams to ensure successful execution and fast resolution of client issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Work with Technical Account Management and Ops teams to troubleshoot campaign issues, and liaise directly with third-party partners such as DSPs, DMPs, and measurement vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Escalate at-risk accounts early — pacing issues, unresolved service problems, or stakeholder changes at the client &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Prioritize your week around what each account in your book needs — a renewal conversation, a QBR, resolving a client issue&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Surface marketplace feedback and client insights to inform InMobi&#39;s broader product and go-to-market strategy&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;How You&#39;re Measured:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role is goaled on two connected outcomes:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Pod revenue growth — shared accountability with your Sales Manager partners for the overall revenue performance of the accounts in your pod&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Individual revenue contribution — a dedicated, separately tracked upsell target generated from the deals you manage, logged and measured in Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;The Experience We Need:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;8+ years of overall client success or account management experience, including at least 4 years in digital and/or programmatic advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A proven track record of owning post-sale account health and driving measurable retention and growth within existing client accounts, including experience carrying or contributing to an upsell/renewal target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong ownership instincts and proactive communication — comfortable operating as one half of a tight, paired pod (AM + Seller) rather than managing an undifferentiated account list.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong account management and client success experience, including managing complex agency and brand relationships and co-owning account strategy with a sales partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with major DSPs and platforms such as The Trade Desk (TTD), DV360, and Amazon DSP is a strong plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success partnering with cross-functional teams (Sales, Ad Ops, Creative, Insights, Product) and building trusted relationships internally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce, Microsoft Excel, PowerPoint, and analytics/BI tools &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills — comfortable interpreting campaign data to identify performance trends, risks, and upsell opportunities, and translating them into clear client recommendations &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Excellent organizational and time-management skills, with the ability to manage multiple clients, campaigns, and stakeholders simultaneously, and to reprioritize quickly as account needs shift &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Willingness and flexibility to work with global teams across several time zones&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Why InMobi?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of a global team shaping the future of the open internet&#39;s advertising ecosystem — with visible impact, a supportive and ambitious peer group, and continuous investment in your growth. InMobi offers competitive compensation, comprehensive benefits, and a culture built on ownership, curiosity, and results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At InMobi, you’ll be surrounded by people who…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think big and act fast:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We’re entrepreneurial, thrive in ambiguity, and love solving high-impact problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are passionate, fanatically driven, and take immense pride in their work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We care deeply about the impact we create and continuously push our potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own their outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We take responsibility, make bold decisions, and execute with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace freedom with accountability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We value autonomy and understand that trust comes with responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Believe in lifelong learning:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We welcome feedback, challenge ourselves to grow, and aren’t afraid to take smart risks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Award-winning culture, best-in-class benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Our compensation philosophy enables us to provide a competitive salary that drives high performance while balancing business needs and pay parity. We&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;determine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;compensation based on a wide variety of factors, including role, nature of experience,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;skills,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The base salary (fixed salary) for this role ranges from &lt;strong&gt;$140,500 to $175,000 USD&lt;/strong&gt; (minimum to maximum base salary). This salary range is applicable to our offices located in California and New York&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;In addition, an InMobian may also receive variable pay in the form of an annual variable bonus or quarterly variable bonus/sales incentive, as deemed per policy, in addition to fixed compensation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Our ranges may vary based on the final location or region of the role in accordance with the geographical differentiation in pay scales in the country.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to cash compensation, based on the position, an InMobian can receive equity in the form of ESOPs (Employee Stock Option Plan). We believe that our employees/personnel should have the ability to own a part of the entity they are a part of. Therefore, the entity employing you may elect to provide such stock to you. Stock ownership enables us to treat our employer company as our own and base our decisions on the company’s best interests. To encourage a spirit of shared ownership, we grant InMobians relevant company stock(s). As you contribute to the growth of your company, certain stocks may be issued to you in recognition of your contribution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A quick snapshot of our U.S. benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and ESOP grant (where applicable)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality medical, dental, and vision insurance (including company-matched HSA)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) company match&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous combination of vacation time, sick days, special occasion time, and company-wide holidays &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial maternity and paternity leave benefits and compassionate work environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours to suit everyone&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness stipend for a healthier you!&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch is provided in our offices daily&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet-friendly work environment and robust pet insurance policy - because we love our animals!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the kind of team, role, values, benefits, and challenges that excite you, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Go for it!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;     &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi is a place where everyone can grow. Howsoever you identify, and whatever background you bring with you, we invite you to apply if this sounds like a role that would make you excited to work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;InMobi provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type.  All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, and training. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role: Senior Analyst- Business Insights (Finance)&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Bangalore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we and What do we do?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group’s mission is to power intelligent, mobile-first experiences for enterprises and consumers. Its businesses across advertising, marketing, data, and content platforms are shaping consumer experience in a world of connected devices. InMobi Group has been recognized on both the 2018 and 2019 CNBC Disruptor 50 list and as one of Fast Company’s 2018 World’s Most Innovative Companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s the InMobi family like? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consistently featured among the “Great Places to Work” in India since 2017, our culture is our true north, enabling us to think big, solve complex challenges and grow with new opportunities. InMobians are passionate and driven, creative and fun-loving, take ownership and are results focused. We invite you to free yourself, dream big and chase your passion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we promise?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer an opportunity to have an immediate impact on the company and our products. The work that you shall do will be mission critical for InMobi and will be critical for optimizing tech operations, working with highly capable and ambitious peer groups. At InMobi, you get food for your body, soul, and mind with daily meals, gym, and yoga classes, cutting-edge training, and tools, cocktails at drink cart Thursdays and fun at work on Funky Fridays. We even promise to let you bring your kids and pets to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why should you join us?&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will contribute to creating disruptive and innovative consumer experiences using technology. We value autonomy, collaboration, technical innovation, and results-oriented thinking. InMobi’s culture is all about rewarding excellence so there are fantastic opportunities for the right candidates!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Finance BI team is part of FP&amp;amp;A and is responsible to upscale the organization towards data driven strategic decision making by adding the intelligence layer on top of this data - to unlock the huge potential that the right analytics could provide. This intelligence layer will be consumed towards unlocking productivity, realizing efficiencies, improving RoI for our various Products.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own finance data end to end&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as SME for finance data sources, definitions, and business logic across FP&amp;amp;A, Accounting, Revenue, and Business Units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build Python and Spark (PySpark) pipelines that ingest, transform, and reconcile data from ERP, billing, ad platform, and operational systems into a governed analytics layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model data for finance use cases (P&amp;amp;L, unit economics, forecasting inputs, variance analysis, close reporting) with clear lineage and documented logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect disconnected datasets across businesses and tools to create a single version of truth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze and find the signal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply statistical methods to explain performance: regression, time-series forecasting, variance decomposition, hypothesis testing, and anomaly detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore large, messy datasets to find patterns, explain why numbers move, and turn those findings into recommendations leaders can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate models and metrics rigorously, including back-testing forecasts and quantifying uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate reporting and decision support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Replace manual reporting with automated, scheduled, and tested data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build interactive dashboards and metrics layers in Rill and Power BI that summarize performance and surface recommended actions, not just charts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define metrics once in a governed semantic layer so every dashboard reports the same numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build AI agents and intelligent workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deploy automations, reporting and insight generation using agents and workflows for tasks such as commentary drafting, anomaly explanation, reconciliation checks, and ad hoc data Q&amp;amp;A.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where agents create real leverage and where simpler automation is the better answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work independently and drive outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope requirements directly with stakeholders, make reasonable trade-offs, and deliver without step-by-step direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full lifecycle: technical design, build, testing, documentation, deployment, monitoring, and issue resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write modular, reusable, version-controlled code that others can maintain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python: &lt;/strong&gt;data processing, automation, statistical analysis, and LLM integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spark / PySpark: &lt;/strong&gt;large-scale transformation (on Databricks or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SQL: &lt;/strong&gt;modeling and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rill: &lt;/strong&gt;metrics views and operational dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Power BI: &lt;/strong&gt;executive reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Claude / LLM APIs: &lt;/strong&gt;agent and workflow development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Git: &lt;/strong&gt;version control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 to 5 years of experience in analytics, data engineering, or finance systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python: 2+&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;years, including writing tested, modular code for data pipelines and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spark / PySpark: &lt;/strong&gt;2+ years of hands-on experience building production jobs on Databricks or a comparable platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SQL: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong, with experience modeling data for analytics and finance use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rill or a comparable BI-as-code tool &lt;/strong&gt;(Looker LookML, Cube, or similar): 1+ year of hands-on use, or a demonstrated ability to become productive quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Power BI: &lt;/strong&gt;Working knowledge of data modeling and DAX (or equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Statistics: &lt;/strong&gt;Applied experience with regression, time-series forecasting, hypothesis testing, and anomaly detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ETL/ELT and lakehouse experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on with tools such as Databricks, dbt, or Airflow, and familiarity with warehouse and lakehouse architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM APIs: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience building with LLM APIs (Claude preferred), including prompt design, tool use, structured outputs, and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Finance fundamentals: &lt;/strong&gt;Solid understanding of accounting, financial statements, and FP&amp;amp;A concepts. Able to build and check financial models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;A track record of translating a business problem into a sustainable data product and working independently as the go-to person for a domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Able to document decisions, write clear specs, and explain results to non-technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or master’s in engineering, Computer Science, Statistics, Mathematics, Finance, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with agent frameworks (MCP, LangGraph, or similar) and multi-step AI workflow orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks certification (Data Engineer Associate or Professional) or an equivalent cloud data certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to ad tech, digital media, or high-volume transactional businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Traits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;You take a problem from vague request to working solution without waiting to be told how.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity: &lt;/strong&gt;You explore data, find patterns in messy datasets, and ask why numbers move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatism: &lt;/strong&gt;You choose the simplest solution that is reliable, maintainable, and actually used.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;You align Finance, Product, and Tech stakeholders on priorities and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for results: &lt;/strong&gt;Strategy only matters once it turns into outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

