&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;InMobi Business Development/CSM team is the secret sauce in transforming publisher partnerships into revenue powerhouses. This team is the cornerstone of the broader InMobi SSP (Supply Side Platform) function that creates partnerships with global and regional publishers. The Business Development team is essentially customer-facing, working with game developers, media owners, social networks, and other publishers operating on mobile platforms. In a rapidly growing market, the Business Development team combines exceptional strategic sales and negotiation skills, with a deep understanding of industry trends, market analysis, competitor insights and a passion for uncovering new opportunities and converting these into revenue.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi is seeking for a dynamic and results-oriented Senior Business Development Manager to join our team in Vietnam. As a Senior BD Manager, your key focus will be on building and expanding our partnerships within the gaming industry. The ideal candidate will possess a strong understanding of the mobile gaming landscape in VIetnam, excellent relationship-building skills, and a proven track record of driving revenue growth through strategic partnerships. You will be responsible for identifying, negotiating, and managing partnerships with game developers, publishers, and other key players in the Vietnamese gaming market. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will also spend considerable time interacting with internal product, sales, and marketing stakeholders to explore new avenues of supply and revenue growth, thereby effectively creating an action plan that syncs perfectly with our broader business objectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will report to the Head of Gaming Partnerships—Asia Pacific (APAC), who is based at our headquarters in Bangalore, India.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Key Job Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New publisher onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify and onboard key gaming partners in Vietnam that align with InMobi&#39;s strategic objectives. Develop and deepen existing publisher partnerships through innovative solutions beyond yield optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive intelligence: Analyze market trends and customer performance to generate industry insights and identify growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure joint business plans for key accounts, focusing on transforming growth curves through a deep understanding of client objectives and challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate and maintain C-level relationships, serving as the primary point of contact for partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the customer champion to the internal teams driving for outcomes on behalf of the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and deliver transformational pitches and presentations to drive business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally to identify next big bets and innovative solutions for the gaming industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop case studies of successful campaigns and participate in industry events to showcase InMobi&#39;s expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular reports on business performance, market trends, and competitive landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Procure any required collateral from customer teams for any ad-sales pitches (case studies, media-kits, demographic split of users, daily active user count etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we require of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5-8 years of experience in the mobile gaming industry, mobile advertising, or digital marketing. Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical. MBA is preferred but not necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in both English and Vietnamese to effectively communicate with local and international stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the Vietnamese mobile gaming market and its unique characteristics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable handling &amp;amp; anchoring high level conversations regarding internal InMobi products &amp;amp; supply-side metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in growing and maintaining complex, high-value managed accounts through a consultative approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of mobile gaming advertising products across various formats (e.g., in-app, video, display).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding in teamwork with strong organizational and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and decision-making in the absence of perfect information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers a rare and exciting opportunity to shape the emerging gaming market in Vietnam. The individual will not only play a pivotal role in establishing partnerships and driving growth but also contribute to building a team by selecting key collaborators. All of this is backed by the stability and confidence of joining a globally recognized company with a proven platform and successful business model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Ho Chi Minh City or Hanoi&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About InMobi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses, including independently operated consumer platform Glance, InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., an associate of InMobi Technology Services Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The InMobi Group is the umbrella under which this ecosystem of businesses comes together. It spans:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consumer brands: Glance, an intelligent shopping agent, and 1Weather, a hyperlocal weather application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise platforms: InMobi Advertising, which provides media buyers and owners with the tools, data, and expertise to grow their business on mobile and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each business serves its own audiences and has its own identity. At group level, InMobi is the common thread: the company, the technology, and the point of view behind them. This role helps shape how that group is presented and understood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is the role about?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager, Corporate Marketing is a group-level position based in Bengaluru, reporting to the Global Head of Corporate Marketing. “Group level” means the role represents the InMobi Group as a whole, rather than any single business. The incumbent is responsible for turning the group narrative into the flagship events and content through which the group is seen and heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is primarily B2B in focus. The incumbent’s purpose is to shape how the InMobi Group is perceived by the audiences that matter most to its long-term standing: prospective talent, investors, the technology community, and industry thought leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The incumbent will be the senior operator in the Corporate Marketing team: a leader who plans, builds, and delivers. The role works closely with the entire Corporate Marketing team and with the InMobi Advertising and Glance marketing teams, and across teams around the world, including leadership, engineering, product, design, talent, finance, and regional marketing functions. The incumbent owns the work from the first idea to the last outcome, including the flagship events that carry the group narrative and the content and creative that bring it to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Target Audiences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent: experienced professionals, engineers, and early-career candidates considering InMobi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investors and the financial community: stakeholders who assess InMobi’s strategy, leadership, and long-term potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technology community: engineers, data scientists, and product leaders who follow the work of leading technology teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry thought leaders: analysts, journalists, and influential voices who shape perception of the category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will you be doing ?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Group Narrative and Messaging&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate the group narrative into clear messaging, proof points, and content frameworks that every corporate programme draws on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that events and content speak in one consistent group voice, across businesses and regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the wider Corporate Marketing team, including social media and community, so that what is said on stage, in print, and in the room is carried through consistently across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Corporate Events and Flagship Platforms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy, planning, and delivery of large-scale corporate events, including flagship group events, leadership forums, industry summits, and employee-facing moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure each event brings the businesses together on one stage and gives audiences a single, coherent view of the group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage event agencies, vendors, and budgets, and coordinate delivery across time zones and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend the life of every event through content, social amplification, and follow-up with the audiences it was designed for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Content and Creative&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the editorial direction for corporate content, including long-form articles, leadership perspectives, thought-leadership pieces, case studies, and video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct the writers, designers, and video producers who create corporate content, and maintain quality standards across everything published under the group name.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable content assets, such as the corporate story and event collateral, that regional and business teams can adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global Collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the InMobi Advertising and Glance marketing teams and with regional, talent, finance, and engineering teams across the world to maintain a consistent group presence while reflecting local relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the point of coordination for corporate marketing programmes across stakeholders, setting clear timelines, owners, and approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team and Partner Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team of marketers, content creators, designers, and producers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set priorities, workflows, and quality standards for the programmes the team delivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage agency and external partnerships across events, content, creative, and production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Measurement and Reporting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define KPIs across event reach and outcomes, content performance, and brand sentiment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use analytics and audience feedback to refine programmes and report to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is expected out of you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10–12 years of experience in corporate marketing, communications, content, or brand, within technology, media, or high-growth environments, including at least 3 years leading people or large programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong B2B experience, preferably in technology, SaaS, adtech, or martech, with a record of building influence among professional and technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience planning and delivering large-scale corporate events or flagship platforms, from concept to outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writing and editorial skills, with a clear, intelligent, and credible voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in video and visual storytelling, and in directing creative and content teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with stakeholders across regions and time zones, including senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing agencies, vendors, and budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinking combined with strong execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, courage, initiative, and accountability: the ability to act without waiting for perfect conditions and to learn quickly when an attempt does not succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Who are we and What do we do?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;InMobi&amp;nbsp;Group’s mission is to power intelligent, mobile-first experiences for enterprises and consumers. Its businesses across advertising, marketing, data and content platforms are shaping consumer experience in a world of connected devices.&amp;nbsp;InMobi&amp;nbsp;Group has been recognized on both the 2018 and 2019 CNBC Disruptor 50 list and as one of Fast Company’s 2018 World’s Most Innovative Companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What’s the InMobi family like?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Consistently featured among the “Great Places to Work” in India since 2017, our culture is our true north, enabling us to think big, solve complex challenges and grow with new opportunities.&amp;nbsp;InMobians&amp;nbsp;are passionate and driven, creative and fun loving, take ownership and are results focused. We invite you to free yourself, dream big and chase your passion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What do we promise?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We offer an opportunity to have an immediate impact on the company and our products. The work that you shall do will be mission critical for&amp;nbsp;InMobi&amp;nbsp;and will be critical for optimizing tech operations, working with highly capable and ambitious peer groups. At&amp;nbsp;InMobi, you get food for your body, soul, and mind with daily meals, gym, and yoga classes, cutting-edge training and tools, cocktails at drink cart Thursdays and fun at work on Funky Fridays. We even promise to let you bring your kids and pets to work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is the team like?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Procurement role rolls up to Finance at InMobi which is a&amp;nbsp;tightly&amp;nbsp;knitted group working to set up processes, frameworks and systems to help the business ride the next wave of rapid growth. We are&amp;nbsp;fun group, excited&amp;nbsp;about the next growth phase and helping business teams in all possible&amp;nbsp;ways,&amp;nbsp;but&amp;nbsp;yet keep the company and management&amp;nbsp;abreast and make informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a dynamic and self-driven Procurement Manager to lead procurement efforts at InMobi Group. This role is ideal for someone who thrives in a fast-paced, start-up environment and can handle business-as-usual (BAU) procurement tasks with minimal guidance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you are expected to :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;753&quot; data-end=&quot;841&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;755&quot; data-end=&quot;841&quot;&gt;Define and execute procurement strategies aligned with business and financial goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;842&quot; data-end=&quot;992&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;844&quot; data-end=&quot;992&quot;&gt;Partner with business teams to understand purchase requirements and manage the end-to-end procurement lifecycle (PR-to-PO, contracting, renewals).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;993&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;995&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a high-performing procurement team, fostering a culture of ownership and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1120&quot; data-end=&quot;1249&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1122&quot; data-end=&quot;1249&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Finance, Legal, and Third-Party Risk teams to ensure governance, compliance, and cross-functional alignment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1250&quot; data-end=&quot;1353&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1353&quot;&gt;Identify, negotiate, and manage vendor relationships to optimize cost, quality, and service levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1354&quot; data-end=&quot;1445&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1356&quot; data-end=&quot;1445&quot;&gt;Drive vendor consolidation, cost savings, and efficiency initiatives across categories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1446&quot; data-end=&quot;1543&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1448&quot; data-end=&quot;1543&quot;&gt;Own procurement processes, policies, and controls; drive automation and process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1544&quot; data-end=&quot;1639&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1639&quot;&gt;Monitor and optimize cost, delivery, and performance KPIs to ensure operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1640&quot; data-end=&quot;1714&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1714&quot;&gt;Prepare and manage Capex and Opex budgets in partnership with Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1715&quot; data-end=&quot;1806&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1806&quot;&gt;Synthesize data and insights into clear, executive-ready updates for senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;209&quot; data-end=&quot;337&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;337&quot;&gt;8+ years of post-qualification, relevant procurement experience, including at least 3+ years in people management roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;338&quot; data-end=&quot;530&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;340&quot; data-end=&quot;530&quot;&gt;Strong experience in techno-commercial procurement, contract management, and vendor management, with a proven track record of driving efficiency, value creation, and cost optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;531&quot; data-end=&quot;703&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;533&quot; data-end=&quot;703&quot;&gt;Demonstrated expertise in sourcing and managing categories such as MarTech, SaaS, corporate insurance, global recruitment agencies, and other professional services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;704&quot; data-end=&quot;855&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;706&quot; data-end=&quot;855&quot;&gt;Exceptional negotiation, communication, stakeholder management, and decision-making capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;856&quot; data-end=&quot;969&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;858&quot; data-end=&quot;969&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with ERP and e-sourcing tools such as SAP Ariba, MSD365, Oracle, NetSuite, or ServiceNow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;970&quot; data-end=&quot;1100&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;972&quot; data-end=&quot;1100&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills with proficiency in data-driven decision-making, financial analysis, and cost-saving initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1101&quot; data-end=&quot;1230&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1103&quot; data-end=&quot;1230&quot;&gt;MBA or Post Graduate Diploma (PGDBM) with specialization in Supply Chain Management, Logistics, or Operations Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1231&quot; data-end=&quot;1325&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1233&quot; data-end=&quot;1325&quot;&gt;Professional certifications such as CIPS, CPSM, CSCP, or CPP will be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about taking ownership, working with cross-functional teams, and making a significant impact, we’d love to hear from you. Make your next career move with us and be part of a globally recognized start-up success story.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager - Product Marketing – Ads Representation Business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;As the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Senior Manager - Product Marketing for the Ads Representation Business&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive the commercial success, market positioning, and scalable growth of Microsoft Advertising’s portfolio across represented regions. This is a highly strategic, B2B-focused role centered on building robust &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;296&quot;&gt;Go-To-Market (GTM) strategies&lt;/strong&gt;, orchestrating &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;341&quot;&gt;sales enablement&lt;/strong&gt;, and crafting sophisticated &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;386&quot;&gt;client solutioning frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a seasoned and dynamic product marketer to head the marketing efforts for our strategic Microsoft Ads partnership. InMobi represents and resells Microsoft Ads to advertisers across multiple regions globally. This role will serve as the lead PMM position for this entire global business line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the lead PMM, you will be the definitive thought leader and go-to-market (GTM) plan owner for the partnership. You will be the face of InMobi’s marketing efforts for this business, both internally within the InMobi organization and externally to our market of advertisers and agencies, and senior Microsoft stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will deeply understand the search advertising ecosystem, lead with market insights, and partner closely with our sales teams to produce best-in-class sales enablement collateral that drives revenue. Furthermore, you will act as the critical hub for this business, collaborating closely with centralized marketing execution teams (for example, events, social, PR, web) to bring your GTM strategies to life across various channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_5a1591c9 _5cc02ab6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of work experience, with 3-5 years dedicated to product marketing, partner marketing, or agency representation in the AdTech/MarTech industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of digital advertising, with a strong expertise in the search advertising ecosystem (experience directly with Microsoft Ads is a massive plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Thinking and Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_5a1591c9 _5cc02ab6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the definitive thought leader and end-to-end GTM marketing plan owner for the Microsoft Ads representation business across the EMEA, IN and SEA regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and synthesize customer feedback, market trends, and competitive intelligence to identify regional market gaps, and evolving advertiser needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip and enable the sales organization with best-in-class insights, competitive intelligence, and high-impact sales collateral to accelerate revenue growth and win market share&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the representation business model and drive the narrative for the overall partnership ensuring resonance both internally within InMobi and externally with key partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate seamlessly with centralized marketing execution teams to deliver on channel-specific campaigns, including industry events, social media, webinars, and PR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication and Content Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to craft compelling, customer-centric narratives tailored to advertisers and agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to produce high-quality content across diverse formats, including blogs, narrative decks, reports, whitepapers, customer success stories, thought leadership articles, and website or external platform content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in designing visually impressive, story-driven presentations for customer, sales, and leadership audiences, ensuring clarity, impact, and strong visual storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent presentation and delivery skills, with the confidence to engage, influence, and captivate diverse internal and external audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaboration and Teamwork&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_5a1591c9 _5cc02ab6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead and collaborate heavily across cross-functional and matrixed teams, including Sales, Account Management, centralized Marketing functions, external Microsoft and advertiser stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to effectively influence decision-making without direct authority and collaborate across global teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership and Mentoring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_5a1591c9 _5cc02ab6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership in managing ad-hoc and long-term projects, ensuring quality and timely delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at mentoring and coaching broader marketing and sales teams, driving them to achieve their highest potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytical and Problem-Solving Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_5a1591c9 _5cc02ab6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and conceptual thinking skills, with a track record of translating complex advertising data into clear, actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to solve complex challenges and deliver innovative solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Project Management and Organizational Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_5a1591c9 _5cc02ab6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at managing multiple projects and deadlines, with a proactive approach to addressing potential delays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of project management metrics to track progress and measure impact effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cultural and Interpersonal Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_5a1591c9 _5cc02ab6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills, with the ability to work across diverse cultural teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and sustain collaborative relationships across global teams and time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional Attributes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_5a1591c9 _5cc02ab6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution-oriented mindset, with the ability to influence leadership and partner decision-making processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and a focus on continuous improvement in all aspects of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Educational Background: Bachelor&#39;s degree in marketing, Business Administration, or a related field (MBA preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every strong quarter starts with a plan people believe in. In this role, you&#39;ll build that plan for InMobi&#39;s North America Demand business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director – Global Revenue Operations, you&#39;ll provide revenue operations support across our programmatic and performance solutions sales teams, as well as our growth management and development teams. You&#39;ll own forecasting, territory and quota design, and named account list management for each of them, shaping both how we read the business and how every team goes after it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sales leadership will count on you as their analytical and operational partner. You&#39;ll give them an accurate, current read on where the business stands, and goals and territories their teams can act on with confidence. When the numbers move, you&#39;ll be the one who can explain why and recommend what comes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a great fit for someone analytical and organized who is comfortable partnering directly with sales leadership, up to the C-suite. If you enjoy being the person leaders turn to for clarity, you&#39;ll find meaningful scope, visibility, and impact here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;em&gt;This role is based in our New York, NY, office and requires regular in-office presence. Occasional travel may be required for client meetings, industry events, etc.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast, Plan &amp;amp; Measure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the recurring forecasting cadence for North America Agency &amp;amp; In-House sales, as well as Performance Solutions sales and account management across North America. This includes weekly and monthly forecasts, quarterly business plans, and the variance analysis needed to reconcile plan against actuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain forecast models across key revenue metrics for each business, surfacing risk and opportunity early enough for leadership to respond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the quarterly planning cycle end to end for each business: closing the prior quarter, finalizing the next quarter&#39;s forecast, and delivering targets ahead of the quarter start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Goal Setting &amp;amp; Territory Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead territory, quota, and target setting for North America Agency Sales, Account Management, Client Development, Agency Development, and Performance Solutions teams, grounded in account potential, market maturity, and team capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure quarterly quotas are set and delivered ahead of the quarter start, and that performance against quota is measured, transparent to every individual, and delivered ahead of payroll deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the development and maintenance of named account lists for each team, using account potential, historical performance, and market data to determine coverage, ownership, and prioritization, and refresh assignments on a regular cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance and sales leadership to translate annual and quarterly plans into clear goals for each team and region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Knowledge of the Business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a current, working understanding of the North America Agency, Brand, and Performance business, including key strategic priorities, revenue composition, and areas of risk and opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn that knowledge into proactive recommendations when performance moves away from plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own core sales operations processes across these teams, including pipeline governance and reporting standards, applying the same definitions and data integrity checks used across the broader Revenue Operations organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership with Sales Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary revenue operations partner to North America leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply one consistent operating standard across every team you support (one planning cadence, one goal-setting process, one source of truth) while staying attuned to the dynamics specific to each business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent these businesses in cross-functional forums with Finance, Product, and the broader Revenue Operations organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Operating Efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to apply AI and automation to your own workflows to increase efficiency, freeing up more of your time for analysis and partnership rather than manual reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Experience We Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7+ years of experience in Revenue Operations, Sales Operations, GTM Strategy, Business Operations, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading end-to-end revenue planning and forecasting for a sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with territory design and named account list development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with CRM systems (e.g., Salesforce), BI tools (Excel, Tableau, Rill), and financial or forecast modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven stakeholder management experience, including direct communication with senior sales leaders across more than one region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical rigor, with the ability to translate complex data into clear, actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in the digital advertising or programmatic advertising industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An advanced degree (MBA or equivalent) is a plus, but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Attributes That Will Set You Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; You can explain why a number moved based on a real understanding of the underlying business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; You produce forecasts and goals that are backed by data and delivered on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; You raise concerns and flag gaps to senior stakeholders directly, with data to support your position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-regional depth:&lt;/strong&gt; You build a working knowledge of the North America and EMEA markets, specific enough to defend the goals and territories set for each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process discipline:&lt;/strong&gt; You write SOPs and follow them consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied use of AI:&lt;/strong&gt; You identify where automation and AI can increase your efficiency and apply them to your own workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Why &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;InMobi?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of a global team shaping the future of the open internet&#39;s advertising ecosystem — with visible impact, a supportive and ambitious peer group, and continuous investment in your growth. InMobi offers competitive compensation, comprehensive benefits, and a culture built on ownership, curiosity, and results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At InMobi, you’ll be surrounded by people who…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think big and act fast:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We’re entrepreneurial, thrive in ambiguity, and love solving high-impact problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are passionate, fanatically driven, and take immense pride in their work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We care deeply about the impact we create and continuously push our potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own their outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We take responsibility, make bold decisions, and execute with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace freedom with accountability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We value autonomy and understand that trust comes with responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Believe in lifelong learning:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We welcome feedback, challenge ourselves to grow, and aren’t afraid to take smart risks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Award-winning culture, best-in-class benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Our compensation philosophy enables us to provide a competitive salary that drives high performance while balancing business needs and pay parity. We&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;determine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;compensation based on a wide variety of factors, including role, nature of experience,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;skills,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The base (fixed) salary for this role ranges from &lt;strong&gt;$169,000 to $234,000 USD&lt;/strong&gt; (min to max of base salary). This salary range is applicable to our offices located in California and New York&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Our ranges may vary based on the final location or region of the roles in accordance with the geographical differentiation in pay scales in the country.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to cash compensation, based on the position, an InMobian can receive equity in the form of Employee Stock Options (ESOPs). We believe that our employees/personnel should have the ability to own a part of the entity they are a part of. Therefore, the entity employing you may elect to provide such stock to you. Ownership of stock enables us to treat our employer company as our own and base our decisions on the company’s best interests. To encourage a spirit of shared ownership, we grant InMobians relevant company stock(s). As you contribute to the growth of your company, certain stocks may be issued to you in recognition of your contribution.&lt;/p&gt;
