&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description: Senior Manager Account Manager – TikTok Ads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company:&lt;/strong&gt; InMobi&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Function:&lt;/strong&gt; Account Management / Client Services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our TikTok business, we work with advertisers and ecosystem partners to help businesses scale their advertising investments on TikTok through effective campaign execution, performance optimization, and strategic account management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced, performance-driven Account Manager with a strong understanding of digital advertising and hands-on familiarity with TikTok Ads. The ideal candidate will manage advertiser relationships, drive campaign performance, identify opportunities for account growth, and ensure a high standard of client service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a combination of platform expertise, analytical thinking, client relationship management, and cross-functional collaboration. The candidate should be comfortable working in a fast-paced environment, managing multiple accounts, solving problems independently, and translating client objectives into effective advertising strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Account Management &amp;amp; Client Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day relationships with a portfolio of advertisers, ensuring strong engagement, timely communication, and high client satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand client business objectives, marketing priorities, target audiences, and performance expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to clients, providing strategic recommendations to improve campaign outcomes and grow advertising investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify opportunities to expand existing accounts through increased budgets, new campaign objectives, additional products, and new market opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage client escalations effectively and ensure timely resolution of issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; TikTok Ads &amp;amp; Campaign Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a strong understanding of the TikTok Ads platform, including campaign setup, targeting, bidding, budgets, creatives, optimization, measurement, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor campaign performance against KPIs such as CPA, ROAS, CTR, CVR, CPM, and other relevant business metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse campaign data to identify performance trends, optimization opportunities, and potential risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend actionable improvements across campaign structure, audience targeting, bidding strategies, creative performance, and budget allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated on TikTok Ads features, product releases, platform policies, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support advertisers in troubleshooting campaign delivery, tracking, attribution, and performance-related challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Business Growth &amp;amp; Revenue Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive account growth by identifying opportunities to increase advertiser investment and improve campaign effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop account plans aligned with client objectives, revenue targets, and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility into account-level performance, revenue forecasts, growth opportunities, and potential risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with sales teams to support client acquisition, onboarding, account expansion, and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to business reviews, quarterly planning, and revenue-growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Data, Insights &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and present regular campaign performance reports, business reviews, and actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex campaign data into clear recommendations that clients and internal stakeholders can understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to identify trends, diagnose performance gaps, and make evidence-based decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate account documentation, campaign records, forecasts, and performance trackers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cross-functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with sales, campaign operations, product, engineering, analytics, finance, and other internal teams to deliver a seamless advertiser experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate campaign launches, platform integrations, tracking requirements, billing queries, and operational dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the voice of the customer internally and collaborate with relevant teams to resolve recurring issues and improve processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share client feedback, market intelligence, and platform-level insights to support product adoption and business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Process Excellence &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple accounts and priorities effectively while maintaining strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take end-to-end ownership of client issues, following through until resolution rather than relying solely on escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process gaps and recommend scalable improvements to increase operational efficiency and client satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate with accountability, urgency, and a solutions-oriented mindset in a dynamic, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum &lt;strong&gt;10 years of experience in account management, client services, or campaign management&lt;/strong&gt; within digital advertising, adtech, performance marketing, or a digital media platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;TikTok Ads Manager&lt;/strong&gt; and a practical understanding of how the platform operates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing digital advertising campaigns and interpreting performance metrics such as CPA, ROAS, CTR, CVR, and CPM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage client relationships, solve problems, and identify opportunities for account growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to translate campaign data into actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Excel or Google Sheets and experience preparing client-facing reports and presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to present insights confidently to clients and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple accounts, deadlines, and competing priorities independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with performance-driven advertisers, particularly in e-commerce, mobile applications, gaming, lead generation, or other digital-first businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with TikTok Pixel, Events API, conversion tracking, attribution, and measurement solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with other major advertising platforms such as Meta Ads, Google Ads, or Microsoft Advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in an agency, adtech, media platform, or channel-partner environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to international advertisers, multiple geographies, or cross-border digital advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with sales teams to drive advertiser adoption, retention, and revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Successful in This Role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client-first mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You build trust, understand business needs, and focus on delivering measurable value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand TikTok Ads beyond the basics and actively keep up with changes in the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; You use data to diagnose problems and recommend practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial orientation:&lt;/strong&gt; You recognise opportunities to grow accounts while protecting client outcomes and long-term relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and accountability:&lt;/strong&gt; You take responsibility for outcomes and follow through on commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You work effectively across teams, communicate clearly, and help others succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable navigating ambiguity, learning quickly, and working in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity and professionalism:&lt;/strong&gt; You communicate transparently, manage expectations responsibly, and build relationships based on trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join InMobi?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join a global adtech business at the intersection of digital advertising, performance marketing, and platform partnerships. You will have the opportunity to deepen your expertise in TikTok advertising, work with a diverse set of advertisers, collaborate with cross-functional teams, and contribute directly to client success and business growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Staff Applied Science Manager to lead and grow a team of talented data scientists who have direct impact on our company metrics. The performance of our models and experiments is seen astonishingly quickly – the learning loop is not measured in weeks or days, but hours and minutes. We live in what might be the fastest model-learning playgrounds in the world, with an infrastructure that enables model deployment at both scale and speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will combine deep technical credibility with strong people leadership. You will build and mentor a high-performing team of data scientists, set technical direction, and drive disciplined program execution across multiple concurrent workstreams. You will sit alongside engineering colleagues who enable our models to deploy, and with a growing variable set of hundreds of potential features, you will lead a highly fertile environment for building, experimenting, refining and achieving real, fast impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Are You?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring deep expertise and experience in Ad Tech, AI/ML, and Data Science at scale, along with a track record of leading and developing data science talent. Familiarity with big data processing and cloud computing is critical to succeed in this environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In addition to a strong mathematical foundation (Statistics, Probability Theory, Algorithms, Foundations of Machine Learning), you are fluent in data science languages and tools such as Python or Apache Spark, and can guide your team in designing scalable solutions, building proofs-of-concept, and evaluating them offline and online.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a demonstrated ability to manage people – hiring, coaching, and growing data scientists at different stages of their careers – as well as manage programs: planning roadmaps, sequencing priorities, managing dependencies, and ensuring on-time, high-quality delivery across a portfolio of initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about investigating and learning from data, and about creating an environment where your team is driven to ask interesting and provocative questions and put real models into production that drive real business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable balancing hands-on technical involvement with the responsibilities of people management and cross-functional program leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are open to diverse academic backgrounds. Our team includes engineers, mathematicians, computer scientists, physicists, economists and social scientists – a rock-star applied science leader can come from any academic field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will You Do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow a team of data scientists working on one or more data science efforts for InMobi DSP, a gold mine that is being explored for riches. This spans project ideation and conceptualization, solution design, measurement and iteration, coaching, deployment, and post-deployment management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own program execution across your team&#39;s portfolio: define roadmaps, sequence priorities, manage dependencies and risks, and ensure initiatives are delivered on time and with high quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, mentor, and develop data scientists – setting clear goals, giving regular feedback, supporting career growth, and building a strong bench of technical talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain hands-on where it matters: guide the design, development, and testing of product experiments, and stay close enough to the data and models to unblock your team and make sound technical calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive stakeholder management as the interface with internal stakeholders such as Product, Engineering, Data, Infrastructure, and Business teams, translating business needs into technical roadmaps and communicating progress and trade-offs clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion thought leadership for the team. We encourage and support team members to write blogs, commentary, and case studies published on the InMobi blog, and to speak at industry conferences representing InMobi&#39;s work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help your team connect model design to business context and end-user needs, and ensure model impact is consistently tied to measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a multi-functional collaboration model, working closely with engineering, product, business, campaign management, and creative development teams, and helping your team draw on the strengths of this diverse group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the space for your team to experiment with multiple algorithms and learn from what works and what doesn&#39;t – reviewing performance, asking why, and adapting techniques to fit the problem at hand, in an environment built for speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encourage creativity in model design across your team. Model design is not one-size-fits-all; you will guide your team in building layered models and feedback mechanisms for tougher problems in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent your team&#39;s contributions in the company&#39;s broader efforts to innovate and demonstrate thought leadership through products, research papers, and conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s in a quantitative field such as Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, Statistics, Mathematics, Operations Research or Economics, Analytics, or Data Science. Or a Bachelor&#39;s from a reputed college with additional relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10-14 years of work experience in a quantitative field, including model building and validation experience, with at least 2-3 years in a people management or team leadership capacity (direct reports, mentoring, or technical team leadership).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing programs or portfolios of data science initiatives – setting roadmaps, prioritizing across competing demands, tracking milestones, and driving delivery in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ad tech related industry experience is a strong plus. You would have applied algorithms and techniques from Machine Learning, Deep Learning and Statistics or other domains to solve real-world problems and understand the practical issues of using these algorithms on large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with software programming and statistical platforms such as R, Python etc., including visualization tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with the big data ecosystem and Apache Spark. Familiarity with Microsoft Azure, AWS, or Google Cloud/Vertex AI is a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of hiring, coaching, and retaining data science talent, and of fostering a culture of curiosity, rigor, and accountability within a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the challenges of the identity-less world, particularly for iOS and Android.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent technical and business communication skills, with the ability to present technical ideas simply to business counterparts and to represent your team&#39;s work to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High degree of curiosity, sound judgment in prioritization, and the ability to rapidly learn new areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is the team like?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt;The GTM (Go-To-Market) Engineering team at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed&quot;&gt;InMobi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; builds and scales the systems that power revenue operations and customer engagement. The team owns a comprehensive Salesforce ecosystem—including Sales Cloud, Data Cloud, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed&quot;&gt;Agentforce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt;—along with Experience Cloud (Customer Community), enabling seamless workflows for Sales, Account Management, and Business teams. A key focus area is building intelligent agents and automations using &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed&quot;&gt;Agentforce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt;, integrated across Salesforce, Slack, and community platforms. These agents drive productivity, automate workflows, and enable real-time, context-aware actions for internal teams and customer-facing use cases. The team also &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt;leverages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; Slack as a collaboration and execution layer, tightly integrated with Salesforce to trigger workflows, surface insights, and enable faster decision-making. On the backend, the team develops and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt;maintains&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; a scalable middleware platform using Apache Camel and Java, powering event-driven &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt;integrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; and reliable data exchange across systems. The architecture blends CRM, data platforms, agent-based automation, and distributed systems—focusing on extensibility, real-time processing, and high impact business outcomes. This is a high-impact engineering team &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt;operating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; at the intersection of CRM, AI-driven agents, integrations, and modern enterprise platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skillset:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Agentforce (Agent Development),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Salesforce (Advanced), Apex, Lightning Web Components (LWC), Experience Cloud, Data Cloud, &amp;nbsp;Slack, CI/CD (Copado/GitHub), Event-Driven Architecture, Integration Patterns (Apache Camel), Java, Automation &amp;amp; Workflow Design, Performance Optimization, Python&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt;As an Architect/Staff &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed&quot;&gt;Engineer I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed&quot;&gt;InMobi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt;, you will be a mentor, technical leader driving the design, development, and delivery of Agentic AI solutions on Salesforce platform. You will serve as the bridge between our CRM infrastructure and AI-driven product experiences &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; shaping how &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed&quot;&gt;InMobi&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; go-to-market and revenue systems evolve and uplift in an era of autonomous workflows and intelligent automation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; work closely with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; product team, RevOps, Data and product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; engineering to build scalable, distributed, enterprise-grade solutions that power&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed&quot;&gt;InMobi&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun&quot;&gt; growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce platform engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and deploy scalable Salesforce-centric solutions supporting InMobi&#39;s revenue and growth operations - including Agentforce / AI-driven orchestration, prompt templating, Data Cloud integration, complex Apex, LWC, and integration layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design high-scale integrations with enterprise-grade architectures leveraging Platform Events, Change Data Capture (CDC), and REST/SOAP APIs to enable real-time data flows across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build features enabling seamless integration between Salesforce structured/unstructured data and downstream AI agents for faster insights and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and monitor Salesforce-integrated products with an emphasis on agent observability, telemetry, and auditability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop best-in-class data health monitoring and context enrichment pipelines to ensure CRM data used by agents is reliable, governed, and audit-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agentic AI &amp;amp; intelligent automation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical solutioning for full-lifecycle projects focused on how Salesforce will power autonomous workflows, co-pilots, and multi-agent systems - contributing to a &quot;data-first, agent-aware&quot; architecture strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product management and business stakeholders to prioritize CRM data products that drive autonomous decision-making, context-rich recommendations, and discoverable data services for next-gen AI agents and LLM-based systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Distributed systems &amp;amp; backend&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and scale distributed systems that interact with Salesforce for real-time data synchronization, leveraging Kafka, Spark, or similar streaming technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, testable, and high-performance backend middleware in Java that bridges CRM and cloud services at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineering excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion DevOps best practices including Salesforce DX, CI/CD pipelines (GitHub Actions), and automated testing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineering teams, set technical standards, and enforce code quality and best practices across squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to InMobi&#39;s platform reliability with a focus on fault tolerance, performance optimization, and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in enterprise software development with a focus on scalable, fault-tolerant, CRM-integrated architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–3 years of hands-on experience with Agentforce, Data Cloud, and cloud platforms (GCP or Azure) and their connectivity to Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in Salesforce architecture: Apex, LWC, Salesforce Shield, CRM data modelling, and high-volume data processing patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with advanced Salesforce integrations including Platform Events, CDC, and complex REST/SOAP API integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing optimized SOQL/SOSL and managing large datasets within Salesforce multi-tenant environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing clean, testable backend code in Java or Python for middleware services (Apache Camel, MuleSoft) bridging CRM and external cloud services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of Salesforce DX, CI/CD pipelines (GitHub Actions / Copado), and AI automated testing and deployment frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Salesforce data security including Data Mask, encryption, and governance in the context of agent auditability and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of distributed systems and how tools like Kafka or Spark interact with Salesforce for real-time data synchronization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at ad-tech or high-scale B2B SaaS companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building and delivering Agentic AI solutions for enterprise systems - including sophisticated Salesforce UIs and high-performance backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce Media Cloud, Order Management System (OMS), Revenue Cloud, or related platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with LLM evaluation, agent observability tooling, or RAG pipeline design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are builders, dreamers, doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture is at the core of that ethos. It has been co-created by the people who built this company and by those continuing to shape it every day. It lives in how we work, how decisions are made, how teams show up for one another, and how seriously we take the responsibility to build the best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where ambition and belonging occupy the same space. Where the bar is high and the support is real. Where freedom comes with trust, and trust comes with accountability. Where you are valued not only for what you do, but for the perspective, judgment and humanity you bring to the work. Where you will be challenged by the work and supported by the communities, passions and experiences that shape who you are beyond your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the place you have been looking for, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inmobi.com/company/culture&quot;&gt;InMobi Culture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi (Corporate)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Group is a global technology company shaping the future of agentic commerce and advertising. Through its ecosystem of businesses — including InMobi Advertising and flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi leverages data, machine learning, and generative AI to help brands reach audiences more precisely and consumers discover products more intuitively. Glance, which is pioneering new models of agentic commerce, is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi Advertising, part of global technology company InMobi, is an agentic advertising platform helping brands and merchants achieve their business outcomes. Through its proprietary intelligence, AI-led solutions, and vast consumer reach — including flagship consumer platform Glance — InMobi Advertising delivers the omnichannel performance defining what&#39;s next in advertising and commerce. Glance is owned and operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of InMobi Pte. Ltd. To learn more, visit advertising.inmobi.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is an intelligent shopping agent, redefining the commerce experience. Powered by proprietary agentic intelligence and generative AI, Glance delivers a hyper-personalized consumer experience across mobile and TV — shaping the new era of shopping. Glance is operated by Glance InMobi Pte. Ltd., a non-consolidated subsidiary of global technology leader InMobi, and is backed by Mithril Capital, Google and Jio Platforms. To learn more, visit glance.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Our Story&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building a new company in the recession of 2007 was no ordinary task. Yet with passion and foresight, we charted our course, helping to transform the way consumers engage with their phones.&amp;nbsp;Over the last 17 years, InMobi has built a global Advertising Platform that powers our customers’ growth by helping them engage their audiences and drive real connections.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi has also built a second unicorn, Glance, which is advancing digital consumption and creating a new wave of disruption. Present on 400M devices across India, SEA, Japan and the US – Glance is one of the largest content platforms globally with~200M daily active users.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we and What do we do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We help advertisers reach and engage with their target audience globally. We do this through a deep understanding of people, which is enabled through our algorithms that respect privacy. Today, some of the world&#39;s largest brands, agencies,&amp;nbsp;developers&amp;nbsp;and publishers are creating great value by using our platforms to deliver&amp;nbsp;compelling&amp;nbsp;proposition to their target consumers.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;Currently, we provide over 1.4 billion mobile users with relevant advertisements that enable meaningful decisions. We display 10 billion advertisements on a daily basis!&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s the InMobi family like?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are an infectious bunch. Be it the way we rise up to challenges, the cutting edge products we create, the dreams we chase or the fun we have at work. We are sure that if you meet us, you will be infected too. Today, we are proud to be the leaders in Mobile advertising and we are sure to go even higher from here. We invite you to free yourself, dream big and chase your passion. We are here today because a few of us did just that.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we promise? &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer an opportunity to have immediate impact with the company and our products. Modern work environment, flexible schedule and smart, creative, down-to-earth people. Internal opportunities to move roles and try out bridge assignments with different teams.&amp;nbsp; Food for your soul – free meals all days of the week, gym or Yoga class to flex those biceps, cocktails at drink cart Thursdays and fun at work on Funky Fridays. We even promise to let you bring your kids and pets to work.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is the team like?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;InMobi&#39;s Supply and Monetization Platform is one of the world&#39;s leading ad serving platforms serving 260bn ad requests a day and handling 2.5+ billion users. Our products help advertisers serve ads optimally, optimize relevance of ads to make the advertiser maximize his ROI, and monitor progress of different advertising campaigns. We handle 7M qps peak traffic for serving ads in milliseconds and manage 2 petabyte-scale data to match the pace of advertising&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
